# Varka Silenos support (VarkaSilenosSupport): the village folk of a Varka Silenos ally of level 2, each first talk answering by the level.
# Killing a soldier of the side breaks the alliance, the level 2 badge becoming the level 1 one.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (VarkaSilenosSupport.onFirstTalk, onAdvEvent,
# onMyDying) and replay the reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/varka_support_ally_2.golden
character Ally 40
standing -2
hold 7222 1
script script.feature.VarkaSilenosSupport
item 7222 7221 7187
page script/feature/VarkaSilenosSupport/
npc ashas 31377 Folk 10 0 0
npc naran 31378 Folk 0 10 0
npc udan 31379 Folk -10 0 0
npc diyabu 31380 Merchant 0 -10 0
npc hagos 31381 WarehouseKeeper 10 10 0
npc shikon 31382 Merchant -10 -10 0
npc teranu 31383 Gatekeeper 10 -10 0
npc recruit 21350 Monster 40 0 0

